Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.52,0:00:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's sunk into the sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should all be alright as long as\Nwe don't move and don't make a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's much too late to try\Nhiding from me at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know where each of you landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no escaping now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.88,0:00:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four, no five steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:00:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.08,0:00:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're walking quietly to avoid detection.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.20,0:01:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you can't hide from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.02,0:01:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears these steps\Nhave thrown him for a lube.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.64,0:01:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, you accursed water stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.64,0:01:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just try to attack us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.10,0:01:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because the moment you reveal yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll vaporize you with the\Npower of my magician's red.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.48,0:01:29.31,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,953)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.78,0:01:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.38,0:01:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.82,0:01:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm. I'm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.16,0:01:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.96,0:01:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.36,0:01:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how much I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.70,0:01:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how much I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.06,0:01:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how much I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.72,0:02:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the middle of the era of waiting,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.54,0:02:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are going to run the time of war?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.88,0:02:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.88,0:02:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.06,0:02:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The story of nook which you haven't had,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to be part of the song,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.88,0:02:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the world to show you\Nwhat you're going to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.46,0:02:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to continue\Nthe song to be part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.06,0:02:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take your way to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.97,0:02:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's on the last page of the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tale of an
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.48,0:02:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.02,0:02:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The title of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.52,0:02:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the memory of the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.16,0:02:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ola Ola Ola Ola.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.52,0:02:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The story
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the game.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.82,0:02:59.65,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,930)\pos(175,690)\fscx84.5}Episode 26: Iggy the Fool and Geb's N'Doul, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.20,0:03:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on. What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.38,0:03:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He only moved five steps forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.24,0:03:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.72,0:03:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why's he suddenly stopped moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.98,0:03:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.94,0:03:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magicians, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.48,0:03:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.39,0:03:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.28,0:03:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can he be so...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.10,0:03:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so quick?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.68,0:03:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to admit, that plan was\Nactually a stroke of brilliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.82,0:03:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to pay more attention to\Ntheir vibrations from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.06,0:03:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those weren't footsteps at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.90,0:03:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem as though he\Nthrew some kind of metal rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And judging by these burns,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:03:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say Avdol did the deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.98,0:04:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But c 'est la vie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.84,0:04:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.16,0:04:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.86,0:04:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone started running.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.16,0:04:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know we can't just run around!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.34,0:04:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stride says he's about\N190, no, 195 centimeters tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.34,0:04:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a youthfulness in his\Nstride, so he's not Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be Jotaro then, but\Nwhere exactly is he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.14,0:04:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It dove in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.42,0:04:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's going after Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.90,0:04:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful he's not attacking\NAvdol anymore, but... Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.50,0:04:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's catching up to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.28,0:04:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear Jotaro's Star Platinum is\Nthe fiercest of the enemy's stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.34,0:04:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Dio will be beside himself with\Njoy if I take care of him here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.70,0:05:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the name of Master Dio,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.76,0:05:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use every fiber of my being\Nto finally vanquish Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.62,0:05:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I heard correctly, Jotaro just\Npicked something up off the sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.14,0:05:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.12,0:05:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was at that location?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last I checked, it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.96,0:05:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I remember. The dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.06,0:05:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro grabbed the dog,\Nwhich means he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.42,0:05:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally figured you out, mutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you jumped out of the car\Nbefore the stand attacked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.92,0:05:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can smell it, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.70,0:05:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know where it's gonna\Nbe before it gets there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.30,0:05:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't stop moving, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Iggy, I think it's time\Nfor you to earn your keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the stand coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.16,0:05:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just show me already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.68,0:05:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me or we die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how would you get your gum then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.32,0:06:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higgy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.22,0:06:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.72,0:06:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can fly too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.63,0:06:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.78,0:06:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and pan all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not getting out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.18,0:06:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinums as fast as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.60,0:06:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're thinking of dropping me, I'll\Nsnap your neck before you can blink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.08,0:06:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he jumped and\Nsuddenly disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.68,0:06:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.42,0:06:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must have landed somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.62,0:06:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't move around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So to bypass that handicap, Jotaro's\Nusing Iggy to find the stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.02,0:06:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can find whoever's\Ncontrolling the stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we might actually have a\Nchance of defeating him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.50,0:06:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:07:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hear Jotaro's\Nfootsteps. Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.62,0:07:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't I hear his footsteps?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, they're flying lower and lower.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't gonna end well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the fool\Ncan't travel long distances.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The damn thing is gliding\Nlike a paper airplane!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.82,0:07:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My legs are about to touch the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.02,0:07:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ma, quit tensing up like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.30,0:07:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're starting to fart again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.94,0:07:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your sake, you better\Nnot let out a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.18,0:07:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.52,0:07:32.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get more air.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.34,0:07:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And at this point, there's\Nonly one way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.74,0:07:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kick got us a lot closer\Nto our destination, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.28,0:07:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the sound of it definitely\Ngave away our strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.88,0:07:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the user will know that\Nwe're flying to avoid detection.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.00,0:07:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's why I wasn't\Nable to locate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.94,0:07:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dog's stand has the ability to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.40,0:08:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now I know what they're up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're headed directly for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.78,0:08:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to eliminate Jotaro\Nbefore he gets any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.78,0:08:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stand's on the move,\Nand it's going after Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He figured it out when Jotaro kicked off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.46,0:08:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing we can\Ndo now is trust Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.88,0:08:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know he was able to\Nbring down a helicopter,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he shouldn't be able\Nto find our exact location?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since Iggy's stand barely makes a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.56,0:08:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have to get to the stand user\Nbefore landing, and it'll be lights out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.60,0:08:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand user's about 400 meters away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.68,0:08:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And from the looks of\Nthings, our enemy is blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.34,0:09:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sand's falling from the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.88,0:09:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand user must be trying to find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.72,0:09:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's using the sand bouncing off\Nthe wings like a submarine sonar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.02,0:09:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of the falling\Nsand, I can hear you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I've discovered your exact location.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.86,0:09:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
