Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.90,0:09:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.72,0:09:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum's speed won't\Nbe of much use, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.92,0:09:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't tell where my attack is coming\Nfrom, then my stand has the advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.82,0:10:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes another!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.78,0:10:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You damn mutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.74,0:10:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.20,0:10:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dragging Jotaro right into my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like he'll do\Nanything to save his own hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.58,0:10:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even abandon his master!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.78,0:10:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard, just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.42,0:10:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you get for relying\Non such a fickle creature, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your end has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.14,0:10:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now it's finally time to\Nput you out of your misery.
