Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.08,0:10:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like he just\Nthrew something at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.18,0:11:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't make out what it is at that speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.52,0:11:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tossed Iggy at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.42,0:11:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd better use your\Nstand to defend yourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or else you two are gonna be\Ncloser than you ever wanted to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.02,0:11:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such insane velocity!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.04,0:11:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, it's going to hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.86,0:11:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.58,0:11:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He actually threw the dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, blast it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.72,0:11:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so close to putting an end\Nto that wretch once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.64,0:11:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I was so busy worrying about that damn\Ndog, I completely lost Jotaro's location!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.88,0:11:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.79,0:11:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he vanished, and\Nhe's staying absolutely still.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must have been his plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.06,0:11:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.82,0:11:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't hide forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.88,0:12:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show yourself, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.28,0:12:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.76,0:12:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize you'd slink so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't had the foresight to\Nprotect myself with this water shield,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you would have already\Nknocked me out from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I should count myself lucky\Nit makes for such a good defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.12,0:12:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given that we're now in\Nsuch close proximity,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.44,0:12:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I no longer need this cane to hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.56,0:12:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, I will require\Nits use when I return home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.64,0:13:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.98,0:13:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.64,0:13:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe\Nbut you actually managed
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.98,0:13:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to knock off my hat\Nyou can relax a little!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.04,0:13:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was holding back\Nyou're not going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.70,0:13:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.64,0:14:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell would you\Nuse your stand to explain?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.18,0:14:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.52,0:14:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.56,0:14:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you thought you could manipulate\Nme and force me to tell
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.78,0:14:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you information regarding\Nthe other eight stand users,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.62,0:14:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.58,0:14:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very well aware that Joseph Joestar's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.46,0:14:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hermit Purple can view\Ninto the minds of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never get inside my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.68,0:14:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never tell you anything that\Nyou could use against my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.90,0:14:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio, I don't understand\Nwhy you're so loyal to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.86,0:14:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you honestly telling\Nme that you'd die for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.66,0:14:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.18,0:14:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.92,0:14:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fear of death holds no place in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.52,0:14:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of the power of\Nmy Stand, I've always.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.74,0:14:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been able to live a life\NUnencumbered by such
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.02,0:14:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,inconsequential fears\Nlike death I could always
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:15:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,win any fight I could have\Nand do whatever I wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.02,0:15:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killing and stealing were\Nabsolutely meaningless to me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.30,0:15:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should talk to the Mott about\Nit I'm sure he knows how I feel
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.40,0:15:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio was the first person\Nwho was able to look
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.32,0:15:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deep within my soul and\Nfind something more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.78,0:15:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was the one who gave\Nme a desire to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.80,0:15:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That glorious force of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.24,0:15:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was so strong, so wise, so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.02,0:15:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was the one and only person in my life\Nto ever see a purpose for my existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.98,0:15:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I waited such a long time for\Nan opportunity to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.12,0:15:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will gladly die for my master's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no matter what, I refuse to\Ndo anything that would disappoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.18,0:15:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after all, evil or not, a scoundrel\Nneeds someone to put his faith in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.20,0:16:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you this before I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should know that my name is N'Doul,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.72,0:16:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and my stand hails from Egypt,\Nthe birthplace of the Tarot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.20,0:16:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's referred to as one of the Nine\NGods of Egypt, Geb of the Great Ennead.
