Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.44,0:16:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nine Egyptian gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.70,0:16:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'll only\Ntell you about my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.46,0:16:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only fair since you're the\None who ended up stopping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.08,0:16:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But info on my compatriots\Ngoes with me to my grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.76,0:17:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio brainwashes people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.12,0:17:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a cult leader, just\Nwho is this guy exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.54,0:17:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and what's this crap about\Nthe nine gods of egypt?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.56,0:17:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all a mystery, but for now we\Njust have to keep moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.22,0:17:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey you don't have to be defensive it's\Nnot like a manger with you or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.86,0:17:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makes sense to be pissed\Ni doubt you wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be dragged out into\Nthe desert and forced
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.04,0:17:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Into some human crap,\Nyour position must suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.94,0:17:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ass no one can blame you for being upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.20,0:17:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy here you want some gum?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.88,0:17:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you calm down already i'm\Ntrying to apologize take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.84,0:17:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief that dog is\Na pain in the ass you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.44,0:18:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can stay out here in the\Ndesert for all i care.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.58,0:18:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.49,0:18:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.48,0:18:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You went back and fetched my hat for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.92,0:18:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're not so bad after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.36,0:18:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
