Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You good for nothing little!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.70,0:18:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're no ordinary mutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.52,0:18:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.50,0:18:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.58,0:18:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.50,0:18:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.62,0:19:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.72,0:20:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sweet! Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a comic book\Nyou're reading, little man?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.28,0:20:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.54,0:20:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Egyptians read comics just like the\Nrest of us you want so many doughnuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, mind if I see your comic book?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.66,0:20:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you let me, I promise I'll\Nbe super careful with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.22,0:20:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a comic book artist who's\Nsearching for inspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.76,0:20:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing gets me jazzed up more than\Nchecking out rare books and comics.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.58,0:20:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me borrow it and you\Ncan use my binoculars
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.94,0:20:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell peculiar the stories\Nabout these two eerie looking brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.64,0:20:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see the creator's name
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.88,0:21:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, these are all such bizarre drawings.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.58,0:21:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is fantastic print quality,\Nnot to mention it's in full color.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.40,0:21:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There once lived two brothers\Nwho got along very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.40,0:21:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Zenyatta.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.92,0:21:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Mondatta.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.22,0:21:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mondatta, the younger brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.72,0:21:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was very shy and wouldn't do anything\Nunless Zenyatta was with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.68,0:21:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was always alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.44,0:21:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day, while his big brother\NZenyatta was away, Monday,
