Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.88,0:22:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what have I told you\Nabout talking to strangers?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.02,0:22:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's lots of bad people roaming\Nthe world these days, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.46,0:22:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last call!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.70,0:22:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bus for Aswan is\Ngetting ready to depart!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.18,0:22:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.48,0:22:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're on their way to\Nthe hospital in Aswan to
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.86,0:22:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,drop off their friend and\Nhave his injuries treated.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.66,0:22:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.50,0:22:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's how it is, we'll just\Nhave to wait for the next bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.20,0:23:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
