Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.88,0:23:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I are invincible together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.68,0:23:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is in our car?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.01,0:23:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.93,0:23:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, where's your school uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.92,0:23:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're acting really weird today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.76,0:23:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way you're clasping your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that would mean no.
